A '''Grub''' is a type of monster that appear infrequently in {{s|Caves}} and beyond. They are similar in appearance to {{E|Larry Jr.}} and can spawn alongside Larry Jr. or {{E|The Hollow}} in their respective boss rooms.

Grubs move around the room somewhat randomly until they line up with Isaac, after which they rapidly charge towards Isaac, similar to a {{E|Charger}}. Upon death, each of the Grub's segments will spawn a {{E|Maggot}}, {{E|Charger}}, or {{E|Spitty}}. Unlike Larry Jr. which requires each of its segments to be destroyed, as soon as one Grub segment is destroyed, the entire enemy will be destroyed.

== Notes ==
* {{dlc+|a+}} Prior to [[Booster Packs#Booster Pack #5|Booster Pack #5]], if a Grub spawned in the {{s|Flooded Caves}}, it had a high chance to spawn {{E|Drowned Charger}}s instead of {{E|Charger}}s.{{dlc-}}

